sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Eng as Engine
    participant Lang as adoc_lang
    participant UI as Preview dialog
    User->>Eng: page.rename
    Eng->>Eng: rename_preview
    Eng->>Lang: references_to (find every xref)
    Lang-->>Eng: Referencing locations
    Eng-->>UI: EditPreview (one file move + text edits)
    UI-->>User: Show changes
    User->>Eng: workspace.apply_preview
    Eng->>Eng: Apply text edits and move file<br/>as ONE undo group
    Eng-->>User: Events published
    User->>Eng: edit.undo (on any document)
    Eng->>Eng: Reverse all edits and move file back
